      "tag": "Primary",
      "h2": "Primary Colours",
      "body_html": "<p>The three primaries: <strong>rouge</strong> (red), <strong>jaune</strong> (yellow), <strong>bleu</strong> (blue). Pronounce 'rouge' like 'roozh'.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "More",
      "h2": "Other Common Colours",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Vert</strong> (green), <strong>orange</strong>, <strong>violet</strong> (purple), <strong>rose</strong> (pink), <strong>marron</strong> (brown), <strong>gris</strong> (grey).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "BW",
      "h2": "Black & White",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Noir</strong> = black. <strong>Blanc</strong> = white. When describing feminine nouns, blanc becomes <strong>blanche</strong>. Most colours change too — vert/verte.</p>"
    }
